sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React GenerationPage
    participant API as FastAPI Generation Router
    participant S as GenerationService
    participant G as FlutterGeneratorService
    participant FS as Storage
    UI->>API: POST /generation/flutter
    API->>S: generate_frontend(payload, user)
    S->>S: validar transformacion y membresia
    S->>G: generate(intermediate_model, name, id)
    G->>FS: escribir proyecto Flutter
    G->>FS: crear ZIP
    G-->>S: manifest + rutas
    S->>S: persistir GeneratedFrontend y GeneratedArtifact
    S-->>API: GeneratedFrontend
    API-->>UI: metadata de generacion
    UI->>API: GET /generation/flutter/{id}/download
    API-->>UI: ZIP Flutter
